44A0EFFC46_poster.jpg","description":"تايو أسانو هو طالب في المدرسة الثانوية خجول للغاية والشخص الوحيد الذي يمكنه التحدث إليه هو صديقة طفولته موتسومي يوزاكورا. يتضح لاحقًا أن أفراد عائلة موتسومي جواسيس! تتعرض موتسومي لمضايقات بسبب الحماية المفرطة من قبل شقيقها كيوشيرو الذي يشكل كابوس بالنسبة لها. فيتعين على تايو اتخاذ الخطوات الجذرية لإنقاذ موتسومي\n\nAsano Taiyou has been on his own ever since his parents died and the only one who seems to care for him is his childhood friend and classmate, Yozakura Mutsumi. But Mutsumi has a secret—she is the head of a family of spies! And on top of that, her brother Kyouichirou is dangerously protective of her! To stop Kyouichirou from killing him, Taiyou and Mutsumi must take the ultimate leap—marriage! Because in the Yozakura family, family cannot kill family.","releaseInfo":"2024","imdbRating":"6.5","genres":["اكشن | Action","رسوم متحركة | Animation","كوميدي | Comedy","Shounen"]},{"id":"3isk_watch__episodes__serie-kod-adi-kirlangic-season-1-episode-91","type":"series","name":"مسلسل اسم الرمز كرلانج الحلقة 91","poster":"https://3iskk.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/kod-adi-kirlangic-4.jpg","posterShape":"poster","background":"https://3iskk.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/kod-adi-kirlangic-4.jpg","landscapePoster":"https://3iskk.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/kod-adi-kirlangic-4.jpg","logo":"https://3esk.onl/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/3isk-logo.png","description":"مسلسل اسم الرمز كرلانج الحلقة 91 — 3isk (قصة عشق)"},{"id":"akwam_series__5900__overseas-security-guard","type":"series","name":"Overseas Security Guard","poster":"https://img.downet.net/thumb/178x260/uploads/fabfs.webp","posterShape":"poster","background":"https://img.downet.net/thumb/178x260/uploads/fabfs.webp","landscapePoster":"https://img.downet.net/thumb/178x260/uploads/fabfs.webp","logo":"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcQ2vuGLv4zY3XpoN2jza2unCQ95xFfypfe-h3k3xteMbGxl7taw-ziXyNg&s=10","description":"Overseas Security Guard — Akwam (أكوام)","imdb